cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CE-SSCFC_Algs: reference implementation of classifier-embedded semi-supervised collaborative fuzzy clustering"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the
  accompanying paper listed under preferred-citation.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nguyen
    given-names: Xuan Hoang
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0007-1721-6931
    affiliation: Hanoi University of Industry, Hanoi, Vietnam
repository-code: https://github.com/longlinh/CE-SSCFC_Algs
abstract: >-
  NumPy reference implementation of CE-SSCFC, a semi-supervised collaborative
  fuzzy c-means in which a ridge classifier on a fixed quadratic feature map is
  an optimisation variable of the clustering objective and the only channel of
  collaboration between datasites is the exchange of per-class sufficient
  statistics of the labelled pixels. Includes the validation gate, the
  backtracking rule on the local validation risk, a self-contained synthetic
  multi-datasite demonstration, tests and an example on the companion
  Landsat-8 dataset (doi:10.5281/zenodo.22304965).
keywords:
  - fuzzy c-means
  - semi-supervised clustering
  - collaborative clustering
  - remote sensing
  - land cover
  - Landsat-8
